# Vendored AWS models: ~92 MB, and reproducible byte-for-byte from the commit
# pinned in specs/mirror.lock via `make specs-sync`. The generated models are
# the committed artifact; these are their input.
specs/aws/
# specs/gcp/ is NOT ignored. Google Discovery is served live from a URL with
# no revision to pin, so the document itself is the pin: it is committed, its
# sha256 is in the lock, and `make specs-sync` uses the committed copy rather
# than refetching. `make specs-refresh` is how it moves, deliberately, with a
# reviewable diff. It is 244 KB.

# OS
.DS_Store
